    <string name="faq_security">Security</string>
    <string name="faq_sec_q1">How is my private key material secured?</string>
    <string name="faq_sec_a1">Dinarly utilizes institutional-grade Multi-Party Computation (MPC) distributed across globally isolated secure enclaves. Your key is never constructed in whole, rendering single-point breaches mathematically impossible.</string>
    <string name="faq_sec_q2">Setting up Hardware Key Authentication</string>
    <string name="faq_sec_a2">Pair your hardware key from Security &amp; Authentication → Biometric Unlock. Insert the device, hold its button for five seconds, and confirm the pairing code shown in your ledger.</string>
    <string name="faq_sec_q3">What to do if my primary device is compromised?</string>
    <string name="faq_sec_a3">Freeze the session instantly from any secondary device, then revoke the compromised key. Dinarly clients may also request a concierge-assisted device rotation within one hour.</string>
    <string name="faq_trading">Trading &amp; Markets</string>
    <string name="faq_trading_t1">Execution Slippage Explained</string>
    <string name="faq_trading_t2">Dark Pool Access Tiers</string>
    <string name="faq_trading_t3">Settlement Timeframes (T+1)</string>
    <string name="faq_account">Account Management</string>
    <string name="faq_account_desc">Everything related to tier upgrades, compliance documentation, and multi-signature approvals.</string>
    <string name="faq_acc_q1">Upgrading to Dinarly Tier</string>
    <string name="faq_acc_a1">Requirements include verified assets over $1M and an initial compliance review. Upgrades are processed within 48 hours.</string>
    <string name="faq_acc_q2">Adding a Co-Signatory</string>
    <string name="faq_acc_a2">Initiate multi-sig setup via the Security Center. The secondary party must also complete identity verification.</string>
    <string name="faq_acc_q3">Generating Tax Statements</string>
    <string name="faq_acc_a3">End-of-year reports are automatically generated in the Audit Logs section by January 15th.</string>
    <string name="faq_acc_q4">Wire Transfer Whitelists</string>
    <string name="faq_acc_a4">All outbound destinations must be pre-approved. Changes require a 48-hour cooling period.</string>
